  "description": "Section 4: legacy id keys are accepted ONLY when dependencies carries the mapping that makes them translatable; otherwise the import is refused naming the node and the key. A foreign GUID means nothing here, and resolving it to whatever happens to share the id would bind the workflow to the wrong system with that system's credentials.",
